{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":224227,"duration_api_ms":194131,"num_turns":26,"result":"All 3 failing tests are now fixed. The root cause was `file_mtime()` in `compat.sh` — on Linux, `stat -f %m file` interprets `-f` as `--file-system` (not a format flag like on macOS), printing filesystem info to stdout before exiting non-zero. The `||` chain then ran the Linux variant too, so the function returned multiline junk + the epoch, breaking arithmetic comparisons in the cleanup script's heartbeat detection.\n\nFix: capture each `stat` attempt into a variable and validate it's a pure number (`^[0-9]+$`) before echoing. Applied to both `scripts/lib/compat.sh` and the fallback in `scripts/lib/pipeline-cli.sh`.\n\nLOOP_COMPLETE","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c2136e69-a531-4d44-a2df-53e7c5188096","total_cost_usd":1.1283700500000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51235,"cache_read_input_tokens":1080533,"output_tokens":8717,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51235,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":24,"outputTokens":8717,"cacheReadInputTokens":1080533,"cacheCreationInputTokens":51235,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.0785302500000002,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":830,"cacheReadInputTokens":77128,"cacheCreationInputTokens":30368,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.049839800000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"cd00d7c1-2e79-47e2-bd1f-0cc01ef4b349"}
